  "raw_text": "R86 recorded-session evidence; publication proposal, not full acceptance.\nR86 session01 recorded-session mean comparison for vb_core step_once fixture operation including frame/store construction and outcome checks; baseline 7f505d498fa35acb5b70b083ac6f02cd40f3a891 plus approved fixture overlay 0175f57b1a63ef7a9a36c67ea0422106c7b4917d124c26944542b9383b968fed versus candidate 06ae752b84172c5484f09e45386208b794cba954. All A1/B1/B2/A2 runs retained with equal per-run weighting. Background activity and variance limit interpretation: no noise-free or causal speedup claim. Quantiles describe pooled sample means, not individual-operation tails. Counters are candidate-only whole-process totals from separate tools, not comparative or per-operation costs. SaveConst pooled sample-mean p99 worsened by +16.61% (44.203054374711286013 to 51.543366956864872864 ns); mean-limit success does not imply tail nonregression.\nCOUNTER_SCOPE: whole filtered Criterion process, including startup, all suite fixture setup, warmup/calibration and measured work; separate perf and heaptrack invocations; not per-operation counters; profiler timings never enter latency aggregation\nMEANS/UNITS: {\"counter_scope\": \"whole filtered Criterion process, including startup, all suite fixture setup, warmup/calibration and measured work; separate perf and heaptrack invocations; not per-operation counters; profiler timings never enter latency aggregation\", \"counters\": {\"allocation_count\": 11376611, \"bytes_allocated\": 136253159, \"instruction_count\": 48605463648}, \"mean_delta_percent\": \"-5.9713757814508460444403716101352401871769845412071692459937262253206283955315410\", \"p99_sample_mean_delta_percent\": \"16.605894515635562098265309680251620923007204310186178847875542003367843383596010\", \"pairing_deltas_percent\": [\"-1.9867070267566772840557398812191398185315234689856068380435152074196223747538200\", \"-9.1762216552654070691068117123379174908361313348294496777822115121107795657